<section>
  <div class="container story-block text-center">
    <p>Hot Mess Hobby Shop, LLC exists because I have never once stuck to a single hobby. I get into something, get a little too into it, and eventually someone asks "wait, can I buy one of those?" This is the answer.</p>
    <p>Right now that means handmade tropical terrariums and football cards — two things that have nothing to do with each other, which is kind of the point. Instead of starting a new business every time I fall down a new rabbit hole, everything lives under one roof. As new obsessions turn into side hustles, they'll show up here too.</p>
  </div>
</section>

